{% extends "_layout.html.j2" %}
{% block body %}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{ salutation }}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">On behalf of researchers at London Business School, MIT and Harvard University, working with our fieldwork partner Morsel Research and Development Pvt Ltd, we would like to invite {{ company }} to take part in the India Business Leaders Survey (ethics ref. REC1101).</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The study looks at how Indian businesses approach board governance, senior hiring, capital allocation and growth, and compares promoter-led and professionally run firms to understand what supports long-term success.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">As a thank-you, participating firms will receive a confidential Peer Benchmark Report comparing their governance and management practices with other firms in the {{ peer_tier }} segment.</p>
{% include "_button.html.j2" %}
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;color:#6e6e73;">(about 15–20 minutes · confidential · voluntary)</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#6e6e73;">Link: <a href="{{ survey_link }}" style="color:#1f3a5f;">{{ survey_link }}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The survey is best completed by a promoter, director or senior executive. Your answers are analysed anonymously and no firm is ever named.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">You can verify this study at <a href="https://survo.tech" style="color:#1f3a5f;">https://survo.tech</a> or by writing to <a href="mailto:ethics@london.edu" style="color:#1f3a5f;">ethics@london.edu</a> quoting REC1101.</p>
{% endblock %}
